# ============================================================================
# m20-map-server-kick.service —— 开机后一次性 DDS 重配对(配对 .timer)
#                                one post-boot DDS re-pair pass (paired .timer)
# ============================================================================
# 狗的开机风暴期存在 DDS 配对疾病(同族:rsdriver wedged writer):风暴中建立的
# writer/reader 配对可能永久楔死,且每次开机受害者不同 —— 实测过 3 对:
#   · map_server→astar 的 /GRID_MAP latch(SHM 与 UDP 下都复现,疑似 OEM 内部
#     LoadMap 启动竞态)
#   · 定位驱动的雷达 reader(rsdriver writer 活着,fresh 探针能收,驱动收不到)
#   · 定位驱动的 UDP egress(handler 换新 reader 也收不到,驱动侧楔死)
# 万能解:风暴平息后给受害进程一个全新 participant。本服务在开机 T+3min 把
# map_server 和定位驱动各重启一次;所有配对在平静系统上重新形成(E1 实验证明
# 平静配对 100% 成功)。重启间隙:地图消费者保留 retained 样本,/ODOM 中断约
# 15s —— 开机 3 分钟时不会有任务在跑。
#
# The robot's boot storm carries a DDS pairing disease (same family as
# rsdriver's wedged writer): pairings formed during the storm can wedge
# PERMANENTLY, with a different victim each boot — three observed pairs so far:
# the /GRID_MAP latch to astar (reproduced over both SHM and UDP; likely an
# OEM-internal LoadMap startup race), the localization driver's lidar reader,
# and the driver's UDP egress toward handler. The universal cure is a fresh
# participant once the storm settles: at T+3 min this restarts map_server and
# the localization driver; calm-system pairing was measured 100% reliable (E1).
# Cost: map consumers keep their retained sample; /ODOM gaps ~15 s at a time
# when no task can be running yet.
[Unit]
Description=M20 post-boot DDS re-pair (one-shot kick)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/bin/systemctl try-restart m20-map-server.service
ExecStart=/bin/systemctl try-restart m20_loc_foxy.service rtk_only.service fslam.service
